tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-234-a-name-windows-reads-as-another-file.hero:29:8: error[machine_locked_path]: this header's name holds `:`, which Windows reads as a drive or as a stream of another file, so `ab.h::$DATA` does not name one file on every machine: write the name without it, as `extern "math.h"`
