tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-234-a-name-windows-reads-as-another-file.hero:35:8: error[machine_locked_path]: this header's name climbs back out of a directory it names, with `..`, which Windows does without that directory, and macOS and Linux only through it, so `zz/../ab.h` does not name one file on every machine: write the name without it, as `extern "math.h"`
